{
  "scope": "New holdout 2026-11-02b: 10 pages from 8 previously unused originals. Visual controls were authored before OCR; runtime, models and thresholds remain fixed. This is selected-region quality, not full-document accuracy or a newly trained model.",
  "exclusions": [
    "Blank forms and digitally composed specimen letters are not scored as real scans. Candidates 000029, 000041, 000259, 000282 and 000383 were excluded before inference; 000305 is primarily handwriting, outside the printed-text scope. Other downloaded candidates were not selected before inference.",
    "Handwriting, signatures, seals, logos as graphics, QR codes, passport holder identity, passport number and bank terminal slips are outside the controls. The printed merchant word in the grocery logo is included as text.",
    "The folded right column of IMG_1001 has visually ambiguous strokes. Its totals are excluded before inference; the legible price before discount, discount, card payment and VAT on the left are included. No value is calculated from another field.",
    "Only the specified text regions and numeric rows are scored. Receipt images are publisher-binarized photographs, not original colour photos; this cannot measure robustness to all camera/lighting conditions.",
    "Images and PDFs are downloaded from public sources for local evaluation and are not redistributed in Git. Dataset-provided model transcriptions were not used as ground truth. Source copyright and dataset licensing remain with their respective publishers."
